---
import Map from "../images/Localization.svg";
import Point from "../images/Map.svg";
---

<section
  id="Localization"
  class="h-full lg:h-[75vh] w-full flex flex-col items-center p-10 bg-secondary text-white"
>
  <h2 class="text-primary">Localization</h2>
  <div
    class="flex flex-col lg:flex-row grow items-center justify-between gap-5"
  >
    <div class="w-full lg:w-1/2 flex flex-col gap-5">
      <p>
        <span class="text-primary font-bold italic">Providenciales</span> — often referred to as <span class="text-primary font-bold italic">“Provo”</span> — is world-renowned for
        its award-winning beaches, including Grace Bay Beach, celebrated for its
        powder-soft white sand and crystal-clear turquoise waters. <span class="text-primary font-bold italic">The island is
        known for its sophisticated yet relaxed atmosphere, blending luxury
        living with untouched natural beauty.</span>
      </p>
      <p>
        Boating enthusiasts will appreciate the island’s exceptional boating
        culture, with calm turquoise waters, hidden cays, vibrant coral reefs,
        and easy access to some of the Caribbean’s most breathtaking
        destinations. From sunset cruises and fishing excursions to
        island-hopping adventures, the surrounding waters are truly part of the
        lifestyle.
      </p>
      <p>
        Beyond Providenciales, the stunning sister islands of North Caicos,
        Middle Caicos, and South Caicos offer endless opportunities to explore
        secluded beaches, dramatic coastlines, authentic island culture, and
        unforgettable natural scenery. <br />
        This home is more than a residence — <span class="text-primary font-bold italic">it is a private island sanctuary designed
        for those seeking luxury, tranquility, and the unmatched beauty of Turks and
        Caicos living.</span>
      </p>
    </div>
    <a
      href="https://maps.app.goo.gl/1ZSGmQHLDs54siTz8"
      class="group relative w-full lg:w-1/2 h-full overflow-hidden"
    >
      <Map
        class="w-full lg:w-full h-full text-primary stroke-primary stroke-2 group-hover:scale-150 transition-all duration-300 group-hover:-translate-y-[11%] group-hover:-translate-x-[2%"
      />
      <Point
        class="absolute top-[70%] left-[52%] rounded-full h-2 lg:h-6 w-2 lg:w-6 text-primary"
      />
      <p
        class="absolute text-primary bottom-0 right-0 animate-pulse border-2 p-1 rounded-sm"
      >
        Click to view on google maps
      </p>
    </a>
  </div>
</section>
